---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---
<style>
	p {
		width: 800px;
	}

</style>
<PageLayout>
	<div>
		<h1>FAQs</h1>
		<br/>
		<div id="join" class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p><b>How do I join?</b><br/><br/><u>Meet us at 1:30 PM PST on any Sunday</u> (Note: Sometimes we can run as late as 2:00 PM) in <u>Downtown Sacramento on the corner of J St. and 10th St. and ask to help out!</u> After your first day, we will invite you to our "newbies" Signal group chat; from there, you could also volunteer to help out in other ways such as cooking!</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p><b>What do you stand for?</b><br/><br/>We stand for the people; all people. We wish to build a better world for all people and all life through our collective action. We are an anti-authoritarian, anti-ICE, leftist group who believes in unity of the working class, equality, sharing, DIY, civil/immigrant/LGBTQ+/human rights, community, mutual support, and humankindness.</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p>(More to come soon!)</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
